    [*] --> DRAFT_PENDING_REVIEW: Generated by Gemini AI

    DRAFT_PENDING_REVIEW --> DRAFT_INVALID_PLACEHOLDER: Failed Token Check (e.g. {{company}})
    DRAFT_INVALID_PLACEHOLDER --> DRAFT_PENDING_REVIEW: User Resolves Tokens Manually

    DRAFT_PENDING_REVIEW --> REJECTED: User Discards in Review Queue
    REJECTED --> [*]

    DRAFT_PENDING_REVIEW --> APPROVED: User Approves in Review Queue
    APPROVED --> SCHEDULED: Scheduled into Active Window with Jitter

    SCHEDULED --> CANCELLED: Campaign Paused or Emergency Cancelled
    CANCELLED --> SCHEDULED: Campaign Resumed by Operator

    SCHEDULED --> SENDING: Worker Claims Row Lease (SKIP LOCKED)

    SENDING --> SENT: Gmail API Confirms 200 OK
    SENDING --> FAILED: Fatal Error (Auth Revoked / Quota Exceeded)
    SENDING --> SCHEDULED: Transient Failure (Retry with Exponential Backoff)

    SENT --> OPENED: Tracking Pixel Requested by Email Client
    SENT --> REPLIED: Inbound Thread Reply Detected in Gmail
    OPENED --> REPLIED: Inbound Thread Reply Detected in Gmail

    SENT --> BOUNCED: Non-Delivery Report (NDR) Received

    REPLIED --> [*]
    BOUNCED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
